  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    This double faced glass maerial will only work
    when using it with the script.
    The "Assign front and back cull mode" script
    assigns 2 same "Graph Glass" materials with one
    set to front cull mode the other one set to back.
    If you prefer not to use the script, you can manually 
    assign 2 materials under the Render Mesh Visual, 
    be sure to keep all parameters the same besides
     the cull mode. 
